/T (That model still works in some places. It works less well almost everywhere else. The buyer who arrives on a manufacturer's website today has already done much of what a dealer used to do. They've researched alternatives, narrowed options, and looked for prices. What they haven't done is fill out a form and wait three days for a callback. )
/E (That model still works in some places. It works less well almost everywhere else. The buyer who arrives on a manufacturer's website today has already done much of what a dealer used to do. They've researched alternatives, narrowed options, and looked for prices. What they haven't done is fill out a form and wait three days for a callback. )
/Pg 11 0 R
/K [2]
>>
