/T (13 of 19 top-quartile manufacturers show at least one product price on the homepage. The standard objection \("we'll undercut our channel"\) is not what the data shows. Most price-visible leaders preserve the channel relationship through a different mechanism: designer consultations, dealer locators, or budget-tier filters. None of them does it by hiding the price. The buyer who sees a price filters themselves in.)
/E (13 of 19 top-quartile manufacturers show at least one product price on the homepage. The standard objection \("we'll undercut our channel"\) is not what the data shows. Most price-visible leaders preserve the channel relationship through a different mechanism: designer consultations, dealer locators, or budget-tier filters. None of them does it by hiding the price. The buyer who sees a price filters themselves in.)
