<<
/Title (Only 12 of 100 sites have direct purchase as the primary path. 23, including most top-quartile leaders, have a hybrid path: a configurator next to a "Find a Dealer," a "ShopNow" next to a quote form, a "Build Your Own" next to a showroom locator. The website becomes the on-ramp. The dealer still closes the deal. The buyer arrives qualified rather than cold.)
/Dest [28 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 2862 0 R
/Next 3209 0 R
