/Title (Of 84 audited manufacturer websites, 15 \(15% of the 100- company cohort\) display at least one product price without a transactional barrier. The 67 others gate every dollar figure behind a quote form, dealer locator, or designer relationship. The 15 exceptions span luxury bath, hardware, faucets, hot tubs, RVs, closets, tile, shades, and tractors. They have very little in common as products. They have a great deal in common in how they treat the buyer.)
/Dest [26 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 3080 0 R
