3208 0 obj
<<
/Title (13 of 19 top-quartile manufacturers show at least one product price on the homepage. The standard objection \("we'll undercut our channel"\) is not what the data shows. Most price-visible leaders preserve the channel relationship through a different mechanism: designer consultations, dealer locators, or budget-tier filters. None of them does it by hiding the price. The buyer who sees a price filters themselves in.)
/Dest [28 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 3083 0 R
>>
endobj
3209 0 obj
<<
/Title (Tools, not just product pages The top quartile includes a Visualizer, a Cabinet Visualizer, a Color AI, a 3D Deck Designer, a"Take the Quiz" guided flow, a "Help Me Choose" tool, a "See It Spec It" component, an AR companion app, a Pin & Tumbler Studio, and a "BUILD" tractor configurator. The cohort's most consistent under-quartile sites have polished product photography and nothing for a buyer to do with it.)
/Dest [28 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 2862 0 R
/Prev 3084 0 R
/Next 3210 0 R
>>
endobj
