<<
/Title (The audit is based entirely on public-web observation: the homepage and one to two sub-pages per company, captured between April and May 2026. Each site was scored on 10 data points covering configurator presence, pricing visibility, path-to-price click count, primary buying path, quote-form friction, AI features, guided-selling flows, live chat, customer logos, and lead-time disclosure.)
/Dest [12 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 3248 0 R
/Prev 3298 0 R
/First 3354 0 R
/Last 3354 0 R
/Count -1
/Next 3327 0 R
>>
endobj
3327 0 obj
<<
/Title (We did not interview buyers. We did not measure conversion outcomes. We did not access internal analytics, sales data, or first-party customer research. We did not survey dealers. The findings are about what manufacturers show on their websites, not about what works downstream of those websites.)
/Dest [12 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 3248 0 R
/Prev 3326 0 R
